    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Present workflows",
      "items": [
        "Ticket files land via factory-write-tickets. factory-promote opens GitHub issues from docs/tickets.",
        "Dispatcher is factory-dispatch (gh-aw lock + markdown). Engine is Copilot. Model is FACTORY_MODEL_DISPATCH. It routes; it does not implement the ticket.",
        "Lanes: factory-lane-claude, factory-lane-cursor, factory-lane-codex. Checks present: CI, scope-guard, config-guard, Security."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Planned or UNKNOWN",
      "items": [
        "Bugbot review is planned. No Bugbot workflow file is in .github/workflows/.",
        "Ship means: GitHub merge queue into integration, then Vercel preview plus convex-deploy-test to ceaseless-dog-617. Queue enabled on the repo: UNKNOWN. No merge_group workflow file is present.",
        "One-click live deploy is planned. No deploy-live workflow is in .github/workflows/. Live prod remains Amit only. graphify.yml pause and archify.yml are added in this config change; they are not on the mapped integration commit yet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Pause and failure",
      "items": [
        "FACTORY_PAUSED_ALL or FACTORY_PAUSED skips factory jobs. force=true on workflow_dispatch runs anyway, and the lane and dispatcher steps reject a bot actor.",
        "factory-failures.yml describes the failure branch: after 3 failed fixes, blocked:amit.",
        "config-guard.yml is present (same check family as scope-guard). It is named in the Checks card because a node has only three source slots."
      ]
    }
